# ==============================================================================
# MELOTTS-ALL Repository .gitignore
# ==============================================================================
# This repository contains:
# - anki/          : Anki desktop application (Rust/Python/TypeScript)
# - MeloTTS/       : MeloTTS text-to-speech library (Python)
# - MeloTTS-Korean/: Korean TTS model files
# ==============================================================================

